    {"id":"SRC-UNIVPM-DS-PROFILE-2026","university_id":"marche","title":"Data Science for Economics, Business and Finance – UnivPM Orienta","url":"https://www.orienta.univpm.it/en/our-courses/economics/data-science-for-economics-business-and-finance/","source_type":"Official course profile","accessed_at":AS_OF,"cycle":"2026-2027","evidence":"The 2026/27 profile identifies Data Science for Finance and Economics as a curriculum within Data Science for Economics, Business and Finance (LM-DATA), fully taught in English, open access with knowledge assessment, based in Ancona. The profile describes on-site lectures; a separate annual faculty notice specifies a delivery exception for this curriculum in 2026/27. This is not a 2027/28 new-entry confirmation.","supports":["program.previous_cycle_course_listing","program.previous_cycle_language","program.previous_cycle_access_type","program.previous_cycle_delivery"]},
